{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game I've been working on alone for three years. I'd be delighted if it gives you many hours of relaxing city-building experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Economy. </strong>Balance various economic sectors and optimize expenses to ensure stable growth and development of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade. </strong>Establish trade links with other cities to ensure the flow of resources and expand the market for your goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge choice for construction:</strong> Over 65 unique buildings to develop your city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive research (over 300). </strong>Discover and implement new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Institutions. </strong>Lay the foundation for prosperity. A strong system of healthcare, education, and law enforcement is what separates a simple settlement from a great city.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop an education system </strong>to provide residents with the knowledge and skills necessary for rapid technological advancement.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve healthcare facilities </strong>to reduce morbidity and mortality, improve the quality of life for citizens, and ensure population stability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ensure law and order in the city </strong>so that residents feel safe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complex infrastructure system. </strong>Build and develop roads, residential areas, educational and medical facilities, and other facilities that will make your city more functional and attractive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll manage the economy, develop trade, optimize citizens' salaries, research new technologies, and improve various aspects of city life. As the city grows and its population increases, their needs will increase. Will you be up to the challenges this game presents? Test your management and strategic skills in creating the perfect medieval settlement!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086120?t=1761919173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086120/c36acb440650ca9a7339eb008961bf3cb16155e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761919173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086120/341a479d9553dcef28f392fc0d5ead91069094e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761919173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086120/341a479d9553dcef28f392fc0d5ead91069094e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761919173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game I've been working on alone for three years. I'd be delighted if it gives you many hours of relaxing city-building experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Economy. </strong>Balance various economic sectors and optimize expenses to ensure stable growth and development of your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade. </strong>Establish trade links with other cities to ensure the flow of resources and expand the market for your goods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge choice for construction:</strong> Over 65 unique buildings to develop your city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive research (over 300). </strong>Discover and implement new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Institutions. </strong>Lay the foundation for prosperity. A strong system of healthcare, education, and law enforcement is what separates a simple settlement from a great city.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop an education system </strong>to provide residents with the knowledge and skills necessary for rapid technological advancement.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve healthcare facilities </strong>to reduce morbidity and mortality, improve the quality of life for citizens, and ensure population stability.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ensure law and order in the city </strong>so that residents feel safe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complex infrastructure system. </strong>Build and develop roads, residential areas, educational and medical facilities, and other facilities that will make your city more functional and attractive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll manage the economy, develop trade, optimize citizens' salaries, research new technologies, and improve various aspects of city life. As the city grows and its population increases, their needs will increase. Will you be up to the challenges this game presents? Test your management and strategic skills in creating the perfect medieval settlement!</p>","developers":["SibeRaysGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086120/4fd8d9ab929d1b2978cecb3482